Depends: ohpc-filesystem, gnu15-compilers-ohpc (>= 14.1.0), mvapich2-gnu15-ohpc, ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Intel MPI Benchmarks (gnu15 + mvapich2, OpenHPC)
 The Intel MPI Benchmarks perform a set of MPI performance measurements
 for point-to-point and global communication operations for a range of
 message sizes.
 Built with the gnu15 compiler family and mvapich2 MPI stack.
 .
 This package is part of the OpenHPC project.
